9	//     exactly one winner (201) while the others get 409 audit_seq_conflict;
10	//   - a controlled write failure while the database stays readable must
11	//     surface as 503 storage_unavailable, consume no sequence number and
12	//     leave the chain tail untouched until writes recover.
